            <div xml:id="m-5d0a570c-09d5-43db-b9ea-4f09e3ab51c9">
              <lg xml:id="m-4dd38df3-c06a-44a1-a5ee-5752ffcca972">
                <l xml:id="m-af4dc467-d9d5-43e1-8fb1-a4fe7fc6c3fe" facs="#m-6313eea2-12fa-4830-87d8-f5466dcfbbf1" label="text-like">oth Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-2633efcc-86b1-42fd-aabb-326fc3eb98fb" facs="#m-0292d879-8c74-4137-82dc-6b3b08f42f5b" label="ambiguous">1019</l><l xml:id="m-50889260-6e1a-4869-b0c0-2057a14f8f8e" facs="#m-549bdee2-3770-48b2-a138-9acfd0ef1523" label="lyrics-like">sunt ab óculis tuis. Quia vénient] tuae. Et ingréssus in templum,</l><l xml:id="m-b24f66af-97e4-40e9-91ae-edf951739e0f" facs="#m-fb919002-9536-4de4-8744-7b6a711a2779" label="lyrics-like">dies in te: et circúmdabunt te ini¬</l><l xml:id="m-8ff47ca3-347b-4d93-b2ee-b64748c364b9" facs="#m-887e9279-ebf1-4aec-b3a8-240e31ece477" label="lyrics-like">coepit ejicere vendéntes in illo, et</l><l xml:id="m-17e41150-ca20-4ea2-9c01-0fca9c4d6a76" facs="#m-cdcf4b83-a0a8-46a8-a987-4a6762ddbf49" label="lyrics-like">míci tui vallo, et circúmdabunt te:</l><l xml:id="m-c9f691c6-88d4-4842-9be4-1204331ebd42" facs="#m-3a1b0717-728b-4006-95ab-370a8f897829" label="lyrics-like">eméntes, dicens illis : Scriptum est:</l><l xml:id="m-61c425a0-13b8-449f-80da-dcaac8676fcf" facs="#m-7c23e420-26d0-4e0a-a3c8-2e2a176ad469" label="lyrics-like">et coangustábunt te úndique: et ad</l><l xml:id="m-d3c2b34b-5f41-4b0f-a5b5-aacc23a50f27" facs="#m-2ea83a40-6108-4249-92ff-10ee112c1ba8" label="lyrics-like">Quia domus mea domus oratiónis</l><l xml:id="m-5eb334f2-3a16-46e4-8fe3-920b0ff591c3" facs="#m-46816433-9ad1-4cf8-a495-a385e51aeef9" label="lyrics-like">terram prostérnent te, et filios tuos,</l><l xml:id="m-e6a68dc5-1668-4d5e-b342-68b5bd053221" facs="#m-bbca590e-6130-4aee-9dab-8ea61fc11fb2" label="ambiguous">est. Vos autem fecistis illam spe¬</l><l xml:id="m-5ba437c4-733f-42f3-84c5-6fe5df5ddf58" facs="#m-0efbed37-b14b-4172-b373-ecba6e565926" label="lyrics-like">lúncam latrónum. Et erat docens</l><l xml:id="m-4f350790-01b5-432c-a278-57666a95943e" facs="#m-a438c975-e686-4891-84bb-4cd2e507cac3" label="ambiguous">qui in te sunt, et non relinquent in</l><l xml:id="m-c0c4f8b9-81a9-45bb-9013-b1a4b6438fee" facs="#m-a1d40353-7038-4060-ae6b-6610a3cda5c8" label="lyrics-like">te lápidem super lápidem: eo quod</l><l xml:id="m-87afa39e-ba59-4be0-8827-e92217c8b1ab" facs="#m-7d45a3c2-2ed3-45b6-9255-c5246519b0e1" label="ambiguous">quotidie in templo.</l><l xml:id="m-4254907a-65f6-4eba-8f62-2f57229393a8" facs="#m-d3733ba2-a9f6-45c5-9959-ebd5861bd7dd" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-7cf9d2d6-924a-45bd-857b-96dd4dea7b07" facs="#m-7d7dae37-a0ec-4599-b9b0-38a0eb31a742" label="lyrics-like">non cognóveris tempus visitatiónis</l><l xml:id="m-b5cb5c31-c8fe-4775-8628-7bb43ac98841" facs="#m-287eac19-79ac-4216-b300-a5b1c2a40c5f" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Justítiae Dómini. p. 555.</l><l xml:id="m-7b0128f8-0f95-4ded-8b2a-307d72a3afe7" facs="#m-92f935ee-0d38-448d-abf3-4d0d9234750a" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-da6945d5-67a9-42d7-a1cc-75e37cbbc126" facs="#m-ce2e30d4-e699-49ac-9379-62dfba5fc85d" label="lyrics-like">vOncéde nobis, quaésumus Dó¬ commemorátio celebrátur, opus no¬</l><l xml:id="m-14c265a8-f772-4a69-85b0-20fa8f6eae6d" facs="#m-6b4deeed-6406-4631-9d56-8b07c3cdee4f" label="lyrics-like">L mine, haec digne frequentáre strae redemptiónis exercétur. Per</l><l xml:id="m-fbd4ae21-4715-4bf4-aa8b-95a751e7356f" facs="#m-1597cd3d-7d7f-4474-ad48-767e57310015" label="lyrics-like">mystéria : quia, quóties hujus hóstiae Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-a78eb109-2926-4d6d-b2ac-402f5cd9cb20" facs="#m-d43956df-718e-4058-8a8b-3834d8fa5bbe" label="lyrics-like">2. Exáudi nos. p. 501. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-fb6b896c-0dc1-4548-9965-bdb2ba54301d" facs="#m-8d66e1c1-b459-481e-b9fe-4731b98ec0a0" label="ambiguous">comm.E</l><l xml:id="m-fb555c18-de55-4791-b64c-37cd64d4c7cf" facs="#m-51ce336d-f8be-4ed7-a047-9a71497cb397" label="ambiguous">6.</l><l xml:id="m-31e9410c-2974-4090-a39f-9ba4928c8e77" facs="#m-0ed6fa67-e0e8-46ce-8558-8df54c2ea430" label="lyrics-like">UI mandú-cat“ cárnem mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-556b5429-ac5d-409d-afc1-e4fa5b3e1fca" facs="#m-52611d71-6e6e-4103-b9eb-e3531536d7dd" label="lyrics-like">am, et bí-bit sán¬</l><l xml:id="m-4b8528ef-4419-410a-b4dd-d8107f630102" facs="#m-a3f3e696-8f92-4509-a77e-9230b5404f87" label="ambiguous">in</l><l xml:id="m-3b9c06e6-2a24-450d-86e4-e06c2a991f5b" facs="#m-261817ff-bf24-4527-ac0f-51756435862e" label="lyrics-like">um, in me má¬ net,</l><l xml:id="m-9ed72997-2a4f-4bc3-96fe-5d86a3d53b29" facs="#m-76b0b983-a021-499d-9e4f-b3fbdc04fca7" label="lyrics-like">et é¬ go</l><l xml:id="m-27d42599-34b0-4f22-95f6-4ff1868b7213" facs="#m-8d9c3490-7ded-47d5-a9dc-23f444b2373a" label="lyrics-like">guinem mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f3c3536b-5a3a-4ce4-b1c2-0e2d3b67a931" facs="#m-aa9c2427-01cc-4e23-a65c-c631f0356683" label="lyrics-like">cit Dómi-nus.</l><l xml:id="m-92bc7bb3-7297-48e2-9757-9dfb7b42c96e" facs="#m-4945db62-64db-4e39-af52-d3d5037ee3a1" label="lyrics-like">é- o, dí¬</l><l xml:id="m-16493064-466e-4f28-8770-8ea9a40bebaa" facs="#m-b2bd9590-de3a-45ac-926c-7dadce422b2b" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-3a30c0a2-95e8-470d-8f18-2dd3c5c0b2b7" facs="#m-f5de9d29-0b31-400e-9691-2961cf8447df" label="lyrics-like">UI nobis, quaésumus Dómine, ficatiónem cónferat. et tribuat uni¬</l><l xml:id="m-a76aed8c-4065-4180-bab7-ccc7a003eb5b" facs="#m-1ec802f2-edb9-48ee-8664-4bf6c2a0f329" label="lyrics-like">Icommúnio sacraménti, et puri-l tátem. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-82137455-9343-46d8-b99d-5cb136f806c1" facs="#m-87514a63-0670-460f-a1c5-fc96b70cec66" label="lyrics-like">2. Mundet et múniat. p. 502. — 8. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-468ee785-0f80-49da-b22b-08691d78d120" facs="#m-bfc23d2b-2762-4a82-882a-be64992a8e0c" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-97661d30-b55a-4e28-9ff5-7d73db4a0786" facs="#m-89db7f8d-10de-4136-907e-54eceedadf86" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-271f960b-6e26-4ece-b579-88dd86768601" facs="#m-0037ecb0-695c-44ed-ba3a-eb3c82574b8a" label="ambiguous">Ant. S. G</l><l xml:id="m-751bb934-b73a-4504-a5a8-41b08719c114" facs="#m-d41c623d-642e-4752-92a1-26fe674a55d9" label="lyrics-like">"qui-a dómus mé¬ a dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-15cbe2bc-9f2c-49bc-ab25-d7b66cbe3b76" facs="#m-8797306d-a9bf-4603-bdda-b8ab192e7af6" label="lyrics-like">OCríptum est e-nim</l><l xml:id="m-449adcb8-afaa-4217-8c3e-4ff09da7dc7c" facs="#m-9dbbdcbf-1c7a-441b-bb78-638fe709f5d7" label="lyrics-like">mus o-ra-ti-ónis est cúnctis géntibus: vos autem fe-cí-stis</l></lg>
